{"4291030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Summer Before Dawn", "steam_appid": 4291030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summer Before Dawn</strong> is a narrative exploration game about a single summer spent by a quiet lake with <strong>17 islands</strong>, each holding its own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Eastern Europe in the late 1980s, the world feels calm—yet something is shifting. History lingers in the background, waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the shoreline, row between islands,  and move freely through forests and water. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island holds something different—objects, memories, traces of the past. Some secrets are found. Others are felt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the lake, the world shifts.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summer Before Dawn</strong> is a narrative exploration game about a single summer spent by a quiet lake with <strong>17 islands</strong>, each holding its own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Eastern Europe in the late 1980s, the world feels calm—yet something is shifting. History lingers in the background, waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the shoreline, row between islands,  and move freely through forests and water. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island holds something different—objects, memories, traces of the past. Some secrets are found. Others are felt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the lake, the world shifts.</p>", "short_description": "Summer Before Dawn is a small, open-world, action-driven narrative game where you play as Robert, spending a summer by a lake with 17 mysterious islands and witnessing the changing world of Eastern Europe on the eve of the Iron Curtain’s fall. Step into a summer break adventure!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese,